{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_204e17db33abf1a41bc6f41792fa78d972d4a19ab3754738d97efe0ae8f3a037","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"urigo/graphql-cli@aa709566b74a snapshot a1fae112f055a480","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8f24222d1f92eb230ff382f50bc05aab20cf1f964065d2010fb6329b4eac4827","slc_e5d9c2a28d19f2a5ad898d20f32d5367a6da55012c84b287c46e09f28125cd46","slc_fe7e23d738d86ae31eb6e85c1d2ac56ab77d559be4004c7260899b8566d1bb2b"],"source_ids":["src_364046ce45b15f8a9a93bf7902f00e2d"],"text":"The `coverage` command takes DOCUMENTS and SCHEMA arguments defaulting to the GraphQL Config file's `documents` and `schema` properties, with options including `--write`, `--deprecated`, `--token`, and `--header`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_28e8e225fdd459e68eb3490e69de9e28102b9bcb45ea232186142099fec1bc18","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"urigo/graphql-cli@aa709566b74a snapshot a1fae112f055a480","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2788402eb4747088131b7354e0fb0f1acd14ecf4a1fe3c184183546a280b87cb","slc_e89df69dacc94be746e392c6333f30d9d0df636a96ebb9f295ca2769847ec8ec"],"source_ids":["src_78a5f297319957d4a23a3a6411b76b72"],"text":"Documented commands include init, codegen (GraphQL Code Generator), generate (Graphback), coverage and diff (GraphQL Inspector), similar and validate (GraphQL Inspector), and serve, which serves a GraphQL server with an in-memory database.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_32f10a0f778c4da145c4ba86b8cab51e3ca03ec2f760442feda6804396366ab5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"urigo/graphql-cli@aa709566b74a snapshot a1fae112f055a480","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_263f0413e9ea96bea232b8ca4b410139922770482bd12d38fc7e566f6a2df538","slc_82640b624f207970d573c2a437454345a1c5b8f7dcc13a6925333de11a45f616","slc_ba0e59093da9527031542c93b4d2ae9d4d357f387a09dd568dd1e27cf0571764","slc_c3798b79cb9b3e72a1ed1bdb293f75ef94d41bea539c6b16db69befe34991854","slc_fce7a1efd49fdb3168f970fca2dca7f0b1469e33b53cc28ae638417a29e5831d"],"source_ids":["src_8b068587ef5b52348e6bfab27deb01b4"],"text":"Plugin authors use the `defineCommand` utility from `@graphql-cli/common`, returning an object with `command` and `handler` (and optionally a Yargs `builder` for options); errors thrown in a handler report failure back to the CLI host.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_86ea5abc6f9243168ea093ee895997e9"}
